  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The xai-ratatui-inline dependency is consumed from the upstream Grok Build
repository at a pinned revision. It contains code derived from Ratatui, which is
dual-licensed under MIT or Apache-2.0. See that dependency's NOTICE and the
upstream repository's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES for full attribution.

Arivu-specific code remains copyright Arivu contributors.
